<title>USA: TABLE - Norwest Corp unit sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Norwest Corp unit sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Norwest Financial Inc, a unit of Norwest Corp, was priced via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Norwest Financial Inc is a finance company engaged primarily in consumer lending.</p>
